      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WESTERN MISS (8) got well back in the Peters last week and was no match for the winner, finishing midfield. The quick back-up was always the plan and the inside draw can see her take up a closer position in running. Can bounce back to winning ways. SEPTEMBER BORN (4) was on the quick turnaround last start and got over the top to score. He's back out to 1400m for the first time in a while and it looks to suit. He's always shown promise, and now he's a gelding he can start to live up to the promise. OLY'S CHOICE (5) closed off strongly last start over 1800m and drops right back to 1400m now. That is a query, but he's racing in top order and he is sure to make his presence felt. ELITE MISSILE (6) didn't have the best of luck last start at Northam but was solid here two back. WITHOUT REG (2) beat ELITE MISSILE that day and was strong in the Asian Beau last start. He can't be left out of calculations.",
